mutability.qr:3:1: a is a let: it can't change
  a = 2
  ^
mutability.qr:5:1: C is a const: it can't change
  C += 1
  ^
mutability.qr:7:5: n is a parameter: make it mut to change it
      n = 1
      ^
mutability.qr:10:5: i is the loop's counter: it can't change
      i = 5
      ^
mutability.qr:15:3: n is mut: write mut before it
  g(v)
    ^
mutability.qr:16:7: a is a let: it can't change
  g(mut a)
        ^
mutability.qr:17:7: mut takes a var
  g(mut 1 + 2)
        ^
mutability.qr:18:3: n is not mut
  f(mut v)
    ^
mutability.qr:21:10: v is lent mut in this call
  h(mut v, v)
           ^
mutability.qr:23:7: mut n is an int, not a double
  g(mut d)
        ^
